# Opus's D1, folded into FABLE-SONNET-NODE-ROOT-20260923-121: a typed-
# formal path root must read the ARGUMENT's value, not the unit's static
# declaration child for the formal's type. Before the fix, get(a) read
# the Model declaration site (value 1) instead of a's own value (5).
# Routed through a declared local rather than fable's own "return:
# x\value" spelling directly: that shape hits a separate, pre-existing
# "a field path value needs a declared destination" refusal in
# l2_emit_body's value-position join-path dispatch, for ANY root
# (reproduced with a plain own-field root too, unaffected by this fix) --
# a different gap than D1, not folded in here (matches fable's own D2
# precedent: report, do not fold in).
Model:
    size_t: value 1U
end: Model

fn: get (Model: x) size_t
    size_t: got
    got: x\value
    return: got

Model: a
a\value: 5U
return: get(a)
